@startuml
title Storefront công khai
hide footbox
autonumber
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam sequence {
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #8DD3F7
  ParticipantBorderColor #222222
  ActorBackgroundColor #8DD3F7
  ActorBorderColor #222222
  BoundaryBackgroundColor #8DD3F7
  BoundaryBorderColor #222222
  ControlBackgroundColor #8DD3F7
  ControlBorderColor #222222
  EntityBackgroundColor #8DD3F7
  EntityBorderColor #222222
  LifeLineBorderColor #666666
  LifeLineBackgroundColor white
  MessageAlign center
}

actor Customer
boundary WebApp
control API
control StorefrontService
entity PostgreSQL

Customer->WebApp: Mở trang cửa hàng
WebApp->API: GET /store/categories
API->StorefrontService: Load active categories
StorefrontService->PostgreSQL: SELECT active products by category
PostgreSQL-->StorefrontService: Category list
StorefrontService-->API: Public categories
API-->WebApp: 200 categories
WebApp->API: GET /store/products?page=1&limit=20&q=...
API->StorefrontService: Filter and paginate products
StorefrontService->PostgreSQL: SELECT products and min variant price
PostgreSQL-->StorefrontService: Product page
StorefrontService-->API: Items and total
API-->WebApp: 200 product page
Customer->WebApp: Chọn sản phẩm
WebApp->API: GET /store/products/:productId
API->StorefrontService: Load active product detail
StorefrontService->PostgreSQL: SELECT product and variants
PostgreSQL-->StorefrontService: Product detail
API-->WebApp: 200 detail without stock
@enduml
